    "pageText": "Skip to content\n\nWelcome to our store\n\nKikstart Dev Plus Store\nHome\nCatalog\nContact\nLog in\nCart\nWhy Pococo Feels Different at Night\n\nDesigned to help you create a calmer room, reduce screen time, and ease into rest.\n\nNo App. No Phone. No Bedtime Scrolling.\n\nControl everything with three simple buttons — power, rotate, and timer. No Wi‑Fi, no setup, no notifications.\n\nCreate a Softer Way to Unwind\n\nFill your ceiling and walls with slow-moving celestial scenes that help your room feel quieter and more peaceful.\n\nRealistic Stars, Not Laser Dots\n\nPococo uses projection discs with detailed cosmic scenes, giving your room a more immersive night-sky experience.\n\nSoft Light That Won’t Take Over the Room\n\nGentle, indirect projection creates ambiance without harsh brightness, making it easier to relax before sleep.\n\nQuick links\nSearch\nInfo\nSearch\nOur mission\n\nShare contact information, store details, and brand content with your customers.\n\nSubscribe to our emails\nEmail\nPayment methods\n© 2026, Kikstart Dev Plus Store Powered by Shopify",
